 consult the[112Gmemtable,[40;1H[37;3H[?25h[?25l[H[K[2C[1B[1mB-trees vs LSM-trees: the tradeoffs[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1B[1mThe starting point — how each one is shaped.[48G[22mA[50GB-tree[57G(in[61Gpractice[70Galmost[77Galways[84Ga[86GB+tree)[94Gis[97Gan[100Gupdate-in-place[2C[1Bstructure. It maintains a balanced, sorted tree of fixed-size pag[69Gs, typic[79Gly with ve[90Gy high[97Gfanout so the tre[116Gstays[3C[1Bhallow (three or four levels covers enormous datasets). The keys live in sorted order across[97Gleaf pages, in[112Gerior[K[2C[1Bpages hold s[16Gparator keys and[34Ghild pointers,[49Gand a mutation[64Gis performed[77Gby finding the page[97Gth[100Gt[102Gowns the k[113Gy and[2C[1Bwriting the new value [3minto that page[23m, [43G place. An LSM-tree (log-structured merge tree) inverts this philosoph[114G: it[2C[1Bnever mu[12Gates dat[21G where it lives. Writes ac[48Gumulate in an in-memory, so[76Gted struc[86Gur[89G (the memtable, often a skip[K[2C[1Blist or b[13Glanced tree), backed by a write-[46Ghead [52Gog for[59Gdurability. When [77Ghe[80Gmemtable fills, it is flushed as[113Gan[K[2C[1Bimmutable, sorted [22Gun on disk (an[37GSSTabl[44G). Over time you accumulate ma[75Gy such runs organized into[102Glevels,[111Gnd a[2C[1Bbackground[14Gproc[19Gss (compaction) merges and rewrites them to discard superseded[82Gver[86Gi[88Gns and keep read co[108Gts bounded.[2C[1BSo the essential contrast is [3mmutate-in-place, read-optimized structure[23m versus [3mappend-mostly, write-optimized structure[2C[1Bthat pays down its debt later[23m.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWrite amplification and the write path.[43G[22mThis[48Gis[51Gthe[55GLSM-tree's[66Goriginal[75Greason[82Gfor[86Gexisting.[96GA[98GB-tree[105Gwrite,[112Gin[115Gthe[2C[1Bworst realistic case, dirties a whole page to change a few bytes, and that page must eventually be flushed to disk —[2C[